Write a Java program that will be used at the check-out counter of Aling Nena's Sari-Sari Store with the following
assumptions.

Aling Nena's customers always buy only one type of product, but may buy one or more pieces of the
said product. For example, a customer may buy a dozen eggs.

Depending on the customer, Aling Nena may decide to give the customer a discount, expressed as an
integer value from 1 to 100, which indicates the percentage deducted from the total amount of the customer's
purchase. For example, assuming that eggs cost P5.00 a piece, a dozen eggs would cost a total of P60.00, and if
the customer is then given a 10 percent discount, then the customer will have to pay only P54.00 for one dozen
of eggs. Customers who are not entitled to discounts are given zero (0) percent discount. Aling Nena's
customers always pay in cash, and the cash amount tendered is always greater than or equal to the total purchase
amount. Your program must calculate the change given to the customer.

The filename of your source code for this requirement should be AlingNenaStore.java. Make sure
that this file will be stored in the proper location.
---------------------------------------------------------
Input:  Product Type
        Quantity
        Price
        Discount

Processes:  Indicate the Product type bought
            Compute for the Total Price Bought by the customer
            Compute for the discounted price given by Aling Nena

Output: Product Type
        Quantity
        Price
        Total Price
        Discount
        Discounted Price
---------------------------------------------------------
Algorithm:
1. Read and accept the values associated with the customer's order
2. Compute for the Total Price Bought by the customer
3. Read and accept the value when Aling Nena will give a discount
4. Compute for the discounted price given by Aling Nena
5. Show the product type, quantity, price
6. Show the total Price
7. Show the Discount and Discounted Price
*/

import java.util.Scanner;

public class AlingNenaStore{
    public static void main (String[] args){

        //declare Scanner
        Scanner input = new Scanner (System.in);

        //declare values
        String product;
        double quantity;
        double unitPrice;
        double discount;
        double cashTendered;

        double totalPurchaseAmount;
        double totalDiscount;
        double amountToBePaid;
        double change;

        //INPUT SECTION
        //product input
        System.out.print("Please enter product name: ");
        product = input.next();

        //quantity input
        System.out.print("Please enter amount/quantity: ");
        quantity = input.nextDouble();

        //unitPrice input
        System.out.print("Please enter unitPrice: ");
        unitPrice = input.nextDouble();

        //discount input
        System.out.print("Please enter Discount: ");
        discount = input.nextDouble();

        //cashTendered input
        System.out.print("Please enter Cash Tendered: ");
        cashTendered = input.nextDouble();

        System.out.println("-------------------------------");

        //OUTPUT SECTION
        //compute and display for the totalPurchaseAmount
        totalPurchaseAmount = quantity*unitPrice;
        System.out.println("Total Purchase Amount: " + totalPurchaseAmount);

        //compute and display for the totalPurchaseAmount
        totalDiscount = totalPurchaseAmount*(discount/100);
        System.out.println("Total Discount: " + totalDiscount);

        //compute for the amountToBePaid
        amountToBePaid = totalPurchaseAmount-totalDiscount;
        System.out.println("Amount To Be Paid: " + amountToBePaid);

        //compute for the customer's change
        change = cashTendered-amountToBePaid;
        System.out.println("Change: " + change);
    }
}
